# =====================================================================
# thornwood.chr - zone 40 "Thornwood Vale" (Thornwick village)
# Villagers use the generic merchant (6) and bank (22) drivers, monsters
# use simple_baddy (7). No zone DLL is needed.
# Monster levels are computed with the server formula (exp2level+2).
# =====================================================================

